recording_files.description:
{recordings}

These download links are made fresh each time you open this screen. They work for 24 hours, or until Home Assistant restarts if that comes first; reopen this screen for new ones. The recordings themselves stay until you delete them, or until there are more than you keep (set under **Reference sources and storage**).

Select recordings below to delete them.

